From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 20:34:10 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] LV9: combat detail inside levels (lv_detail.h,
 levels_detail.c), mapc awake key and new MDET kinds, test map and tests,
 hooks behind the existing option

Pure module: drop steps per mode and held pressure with hysteresis, awake caps per mode and platform,
Smooth loot and prop thinning that never drops a key, a secret, a collectible or a quest thing.
Hooks (combat.c spawn, combat_scene.c view detail) are compiled out on the PS1 and see no ext on v1 maps.

